    <string name="about_summary">Hitomoji is an offline trainer for Japanese kanji. A calendar day can introduce up to five new characters from the five hundred most frequent. A missed day does not add another five. Reviews come separately, based on how well you remembered the character.</string>
    <string name="about_sources">Characters, readings, and stroke counts come from KANJIDIC2. The Russian meanings are translations of the English KANJIDIC2 glosses. Those glosses come from JMdict, so the data includes material derived from JMdict. The example sentences were written for Hitomoji.</string>
